  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper. ",
    "Place the dum wrappers on the baking sheet. ",
    "Place a smoked kipper in the center of each wrapper. ",
    "Add a slice of ginger, a clove of garlic, and a sprinkle of chopped cilantro to the kipper. ",
    "Drizzle with lemon juice and coconut oil. ",
    "Fold the dum wrappers over the filling, pressing the edges to seal. ",
    "Place the dum on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper. ",
    "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes, or until the dum are golden brown. ",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "If desired, sprinkle with crushed red pepper for added heat."
  ],
